From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursor@example.com>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 17:28:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] libhailort: set stable ABI soname

libhailort currently embeds the full product version in SONAME, which makes
minor releases appear ABI-incompatible even when they are compatible. Restore
the intended ABI-major SONAME by enabling SOVERSION.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [project-specific ABI policy]
---
 hailort/libhailort/src/CMakeLists.txt | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/hailort/libhailort/src/CMakeLists.txt b/hailort/libhailort/src/CMakeLists.txt
index 6630429..28d27ef 100644
--- a/hailort/libhailort/src/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/hailort/libhailort/src/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -162,7 +162,7 @@ set_target_properties(libhailort PROPERTIES
     PUBLIC_HEADER "${HAILORT_PUBLIC_HEADERS}"
     PREFIX ""
     VERSION ${HAILORT_MAJOR_VERSION}.${HAILORT_MINOR_VERSION}.${HAILORT_REVISION_VERSION}
-    # SOVERSION ${HAILORT_MAJOR_VERSION}
+    SOVERSION ${HAILORT_MAJOR_VERSION}
 
     CXX_STANDARD              17
     CXX_STANDARD_REQUIRED     YES
-- 
